				{
					"name": "GET - Recherche",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{clientToken}}"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/produits/recherche?nom=Produit",
							"host": [
								"{{baseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"produits",
								"recherche"
							],
							"query": [
								{
									"key": "nom",
									"value": "Produit"
								}
							]
						},
						"description": "## Endpoint Description\n\nThis endpoint allows users to search for products based on their name. It retrieves a list of products that match the specified criteria.\n\n### Request\n\n- **Method**: GET\n    \n- **URL**: `{{baseUrl}}/api/produits/recherche`\n    \n\n#### Query Parameters\n\n- **nom** (string): The name of the product to search for. This parameter is used to filter the products returned in the response.\n    \n\n### Response\n\n- **Status Code**: 200 OK\n    \n- **Content-Type**: application/json\n    \n\n#### Response Structure\n\nThe response will be a JSON array containing objects that represent the products found. Each product object includes the following fields:\n\n- **actif** (boolean): Indicates whether the product is active.\n    \n- **description** (string): A description of the product. This may be empty if no description is available.\n    \n- **id** (integer): The unique identifier for the product.\n    \n- **nom** (string): The name of the product.\n    \n- **prix** (integer): The price of the product.\n    \n- **quantiteStock** (integer): The quantity of the product available in stock.\n    \n- **reference** (string): A reference code for the product.\n    \n\n### Example Response\n\n``` json\n[\n    {\n        \"actif\": true,\n        \"description\": \"\",\n        \"id\": 0,\n        \"nom\": \"\",\n        \"prix\": 0,\n        \"quantiteStock\": 0,\n        \"reference\": \"\"\n    }\n]\n\n ```\n\n### Usage Notes\n\n- Ensure that the `nom` parameter is properly encoded in the URL to avoid issues with special characters.\n    \n- The response will return an array, which may be empty if no products match the search criteria.\n    \n- Always check the `actif` field to determine if the product is currently available for sale."
					},
					"response": []
				},
